{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301340","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301340","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130134001:1":{"text":"あぁ、でもその前にウール族と取引をするつもりだ。","source_cn":"嗯，但离开之前我们会和乌尔氏族交易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8643FB4A52701A80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130134002:1":{"text":"商隊の目的地は鹹水町だから、先を急いでるんだよ。","source_cn":"我们之所以着急离开，是因为商队的目的地是咸水镇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ABAF570F3D20102","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130134003:1":{"text":"あそこの人たちは荒っぽいらしいから、着いたら大変な目に遭うんじゃないかと心配なんだが……","source_cn":"据说那镇子的民风彪悍，我真担心去到那边会遇到什么刁难——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72742C3050E21C64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130134004:1":{"text":"でも、危険あってこその商売だからな。","source_cn":"不过，做生意怎么可能不承担风险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8BC2C864B133ED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人塔林塔":{"text":"商人タリンタ","source":"商人塔林塔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}